return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:50:35+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Yana haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizo na WordPress da Zinn Digital® domin a iya buga labaran da aka tsara a ciki. Manna lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafawarka na Zinn® kuma manhajar za ta saita bayanan shigarta da kanta — ba a kwafi komai da hannu ba.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana. Buga sabuwar ƙima domin maye gurbinta.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jeri…','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan jerin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara layi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan layin','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani','Overview'=>'Taƙaitaccen bayani','Copied'=>'An Kwafa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane manhajar Zinn® a wannan rukunin yanar gizo, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗi don wannan manhaja ta plugin.','Open settings'=>'Bude saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ku da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sassan saituna','Support'=>'Taimako','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Fitar da saituna','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake saita zuwa na asali','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai mayar da kowane saiti na wannan manhaja zuwa yadda yake da asali. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken matsala don tallafi','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saituna','Import'=>'Shigo da shi','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa taɓa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamu ko maɓallan API — za ku buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon shafin.','Settings saved.'=>'An ajiye saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dukkan saitunan wannan manhaja sun koma yadda suke a asali.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Wannan aikin ba ya samuwa.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani manhajar ƙari ta Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fayil ɗin ya yi girma da yawa da zai zama fayil ɗin fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwar saitunan Zinn® ba ne.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin daga wani daban na plugin (%s), don haka shigo da shi a nan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai gane ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Ba a taɓa haɗa kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API a cikin fitarwa ba, don haka sake shigar da su.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Girman ma\'ajiyar zai kai %1$d MB, wanda ya zarce iyakar %2$d MB da aka saita a wannan rukunin yanar gizon. Ka ƙara iyakar, ko ka cire wasu manyan fayiloli, a shafin Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP na wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba zai iya ƙirƙirar taskoki ba, saboda haka ba a iya yin ajiyar waje ba.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Ba a iya ƙirƙirar fayil na ɗan lokaci ba.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Ba a iya adana fayilolin wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP na wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba zai iya matse fayilolin adanawa ba, saboda haka ba a iya yin kwafin ajiya ba.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Ajiye kwafin wannan rukunin yanar gizo yana buƙatar kimanin %1$s na sararin wucin gadi kuma %2$s kawai ke da sarari, don haka ba a yi ƙoƙarin yi ba.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Wannan mai amfani da WordPress ba zai iya buga rubuce-rubuce ba, don haka haɗin da aka yi a yanzu ba zai iya bugawa ba kuma. Shiga a matsayin mai amfani da zai iya, sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'An kashe kalmomin sirri na manhaja a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, saboda haka ba za mu iya ƙirƙirar bayanan shaida ba. Nemi mai masaukin ku ya kunna su, ko ku haɗa rukunin yanar gizon da kalmar sirri da ku da kanku kuka ƙirƙira a cikin allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® ɗinku.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress bai ƙirƙiri shaidar shiga don wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Ba a aika komai koina ba.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Ba mu sami damar isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Ba a haɗa komai ba, kuma an cire shaidar da muka ƙirƙira. Bincika ko rukunin yanar gizon na iya yin buƙatun fita, sannan a sake gwadawa.','Zinn Digital® could not finish connecting this site. The problem is on our side, not with your pairing code — nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. The same pairing code still works: try again in a few minutes.'=>'Zinn Digital® ba ta iya gama haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Matsalar tana daga ɓangarenmu ne, ba daga lambar haɗin ku ba — ba a haɗa komai ba, kuma an cire bayanan shaidar da muka ƙirƙira. Wannan lambar haɗin tana nan tana aiki: sake gwadawa nan da \'yan mintuna.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® bai karɓi waccan lambar haɗawa ba. Ba a haɗa komai ba. Ƙirƙiri sabuwar lamba a cikin allon sarrafawarka sannan ka sake gwadawa.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'An haɗa. Zinn Digital® zai iya bugawa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon yanzu.','Connected'=>'An Haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma akwai abin da ke buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Yana aiki a kan asusunka na kanka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan manhaja ba ta faɗi dalili ba. Aika rahoton binciken matsala kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An duba na ƙarshe %s da suka wuce.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗewa a wani sabon shafi)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shi ne ainihin abin da za a aika — babu wani abu dabam, kuma babu wani abu a ɓoye. Kalmomin shigarku, alamomin shaida da maɓallan API ba sa cikinsa.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken cutar da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafa zuwa allon kwafi','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika wannan rahoton zuwa ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna buɗe muku tikitin tallafi kuma mu ba da amsa ta imel. Idan kun fi son kada ku aika shi, ku kwafoshi a sama sannan ku manna shi a cikin tikiti da kanku.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® daga wannan uwar garken (%s) ba. Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti a maimakon haka — babu wani abu da ba daidai ba game da saitunanku.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Sashen tallafi na Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonka kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'An aika. Tallafin Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonka — lafazin %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Kun aika rahotanni da yawa cikin kankanin lokaci. Jira na \'yan mintuna sannan ku sake gwadawa — na farkon sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — wannan matsalar daga gare mu ce, ba daga gare ku ba. Sake gwadawa nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi karɓar rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama kuma buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lambar.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mai wannan shafin ya kashe loda hotuna don Zinn Digital® a cikin saitunan Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mai wannan shafin ya kashe gyare-gyare ga labaran da ke akwai don Zinn Digital® a cikin saitunan Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Sabuwar makala a dandalinku: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta ƙara maƙala a rukunin yanar gizonku.

Take: %1$s
Gyara shi: %2$s
Matsayi: %3$s

Kashe waɗannan imel ɗin a allon Zinn Digital® → Mai haɗawa → Buga.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani na %s','Hide this'=>'Ɓoye wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Bakuncin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaran kowace rana, sauya wurin aiki kyauta, da allon sarrafawa da aka gina don mutanen da ke gudanar da shafuka fiye da ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwar Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayi kuma sayar da shafukan da aka kafa, yankuna da wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da ajiye kuɗin cikin aminci har sai ɓangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ɗauki hayar mutanen da wannan ne sana\'arsu','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwar mu ta duniya ta \'yan kasuwa masu zaman kansu: bincika sama da ayyuka 10,000 da aka shirya daga marubuta, masu ƙira, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya aiki kuma bari su ba da tayi.','Connector'=>'Mai haɗawa','Connection'=>'Haɗi','Publishing'=>'Ana wallafawa','Backups'=>'Ajiye bayanan sirri','Advanced'=>'Na ci gaba','Check the connection now'=>'Duba haɗin yanzu','Disconnect this site'=>'Cire haɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Wannan yana soke takardar izini da Zinn Digital® ke amfani da ita, saboda haka ba za mu ƙara iya wallafawa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Duk abin da aka riga aka wallafa zai ci gaba da zama. Ci gaba?','What we may do on this site'=>'Abin da za mu iya yi a wannan rukunin yanar gizon','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Shaidar da muke da ita kalmar sirri ce ta aikace-aikacen WordPress ta yau da kullun, don haka WordPress da kanta ke yanke shawarar abin da zai yiwu. Waɗannan suna ƙara taƙaita shi, a ɓangarenku.','Publish articles as'=>'Buga labarai a matsayin','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Zaɓi "daftari" idan ka fi son karanta komai kafin ya fita a buɗe.','Published straight away'=>'An buga nan take','A draft, for me to review'=>'Daftari, domin in duba','Pending review'=>'Ana jiran bita','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'An tsara lokaci, ta amfani da ranar da muka tura','Show the author as'=>'Nuna marubucin a matsayin','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Wanne daga cikin masu amfani da shafinku ne yake bayyana a matsayin marubuci. Wannan ba ya canza wanda muke shiga da asusunsa.','Put articles in'=>'Sanya maƙaloli a ciki','Allow images'=>'Bada izinin hotuna','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'Bari Zinn Digital® ya loda hotuna zuwa ɗakin karatun kafofin watsa labarai na wannan rukunin yanar gizon','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Kashe wannan kuma talifofi za su zo ba tare da hotunansu ba. Ba za a cire duk abin da aka riga aka ɗora ba.','Allow edits'=>'Bada izinin gyare-gyare','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'Bari Zinn Digital® ya sabunta labarin da ya wallafa a baya','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'Ana amfani da shi don gyare-gyare da sake ingantawa. Ba ya taɓa duk abin da ka rubuta da kanka.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Sanar da ni lokacin da aka buga wani abu','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Bar shi a banza don kada a tura imel. Saƙo ɗaya ga kowane maƙala, daga shafinka.','Off-site backups'=>'Ajiye bayanai na waje','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Wannan rukunin yanar gizon yana tura ma\'ajiyar ajiyarsa kai tsaye zuwa ma\'ajiyar Zinn®. Babu abin da ke ratsa sabarorinmu a kan hanya.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Ajiye kofin wannan shafin zuwa Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Alamar ajiyar gado','Paste the token shown on this site’s Backups tab in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when you chose the plugin connection. It is shown there only once; saving the connection again issues a new one.'=>'Manna alamar da aka nuna a shafin Ajiye Bayanai na wannan rukunin yanar gizo a cikin allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® lokacin da kuka zaɓi haɗin toshewa. Ana nuna ta a can sau ɗaya kawai; sake ajiye haɗin yana fitar da sabuwa.','Leave these out'=>'Bar waɗannan a waje','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Hanya ɗaya a kowane layi, dangance da wp-content — misali <code>cache</code> ko <code>uploads/backups</code>. Ma\'ajiyar cache da kundayen adireshi na sauran manhajojin ajiye bayanai sune aka fi saba amfani da su.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Tsaya idan taskar za ta zarce','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabytes. Yawancin lokaci uwar garken da ake rabawa (shared host) tana katse babban rumbun ajiya a tsakiyar aiki; saita iyaka yana mayar da hakan sakon gargadi maimakon gazawa ba tare da sanarwa ba.','Detailed logging'=>'Cikakken shigar da bayanai','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Yi rikodin abin da wannan manhaja mai ƙari ke yi, don samun tallafi','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'Ana ajiye shi a wannan rukunin yanar gizo, an iyakance shi ga shigarwar 50 na ƙarshe, kuma an haɗa shi a cikin rahoton bincike. Kunna shi kafin sake fuskantar matsala.','On uninstall'=>'Lokacin cirewa','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Goge saitunan wannan manhaja lokacin da aka cire ta','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Cire shigarwa ba ya taɓa soke kalmar sirri ta manhaja — an yi hakan ne da gangan, domin cirewa don gwada wani abu daban ba zai ɓata wallafawarku ba. Yi amfani da Cire Haɗi da ke sama idan kuna son a cire bayanan shaidar.','The user we sign in as'=>'Mai amfani da muke shiga a matsayinsa','The site’s default category'=>'Rukunin asali na shafin','Connect this site again'=>'Sake haɗa wannan shafin','Connect this site'=>'Haɗa wannan shafin','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Bude allon sarrafawa na Zinn Digital® ɗinka, je zuwa Abun ciki → Sauran shafuka, sannan danna "Samu lambar haɗawa". Manna shi a ƙasa.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Sake haɗawa yana ƙirƙirar sabuwar shaidar shiga sannan ya bar tsohuwar a wurin — fara amfani da Cire haɗi idan kuna son a cire tsohuwar.','Pairing code'=>'Lambar haɗawa','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Yana ƙarewa bayan minti talatin da samar da shi, kuma ana iya amfani da shi sau ɗaya kawai.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Ba a ba ku izinin haɗa wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Wannan shafin ba ya da alaƙa da Zinn Digital®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it into this plugin’s settings.'=>'Babu wata matsala — kawai ba a haɗa shi ba tukuna. Samu lambar haɗawa daga allon sarrafawa na Zinn® naka kuma liƙa shi a cikin saitunan wannan manhaja.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Bude allon sarrafawa na na Zinn®','The connection is broken.'=>'Haɗin ya katse.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Mai amfani da WordPress wanda bayanan sirrin na sa ne (%s) baya kan wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma, saboda haka babu abin da muke aikawa da za a iya bugawa. Sake haɗawa a matsayin mai amfani wanda zai iya bugawa.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'An share kalmar sirri ta manhajar "Zinn Digital® (publishing)" daga wannan rukunin yanar gizon, saboda haka ba za mu iya sake shiga ba. Sake haɗawa don ƙirƙirar sabuwa — babu wani abu da ya ɓace.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Duba kalmomin sirri na manhajar wannan rukunin yanar gizo','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'An haɗa, amma wallafawa za ta faskara.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Shaidar ta %s ce, kuma wannan mai amfani ba zai iya sake buga rubuce-rubuce ba. Shiga ciki yana aiki har yanzu, saboda haka babu abin da ya yi kama da kuskure har sai lokacin da labarin ya isa. Ba wa wannan mai amfani damar bugawa, ko kuma sake haɗawa a matsayin wanda zai iya.','Edit that user'=>'Gyara wancan mai amfani','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'An haɗa a nan — ba mu sami damar tuntuɓar Zinn Digital® ba don tabbatarwa.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'An haɗa, amma asusunka na Zinn® yana buƙatar kulawa.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'An haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'An haɗa zuwa Zinn Digital® a matsayin %s.','Publishing as'=>'Ana bugawa a matsayin','Zinn® site ID'=>'ID ɗin shafin Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Wannan uwar garken ba ta iya isa ga api.zinndigital.com (%s) ba. Wannan yawanci katangar kariya ce (firewall) ko kuma dokar haɗin waje a kan mai masaukin ku, ba matsala ba ce da asusun ku na Zinn® — wallafawa na iya ci gaba da aiki.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya ba da amsa da kuskure daga nasa bangaren — wannan daga bangarenmu ne, ba daga naku ba. Buga abubuwa ba zai shafu ba yayin da ake share wannan matsalar.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Asusunka na Zinn® ba zai iya yin wallafa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba a halin yanzu. Shafin kula da bayananka ya bayyana dalili.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® ya bayar da amsar HTTP %d, wanda ba mu gane ba. Aika rahoton bincike daga shafin Tallafi kuma za mu duba — kada ka canza komai a nan da farko.','Check again now'=>'Sake dubawa yanzu','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'An duba. Haɗin yana aiki.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'Ba mu iya cire kalmar sirri ta manhajar ba, don haka wannan rukunin yanar gizon yana nan a haɗe. Goge “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” a allon bayanan martabarku sannan ku sake gwadawa — ba mu canza komai ba.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'An cire haɗin. An soke kalmar sirri ta manhajar, don haka Zinn Digital® ba zai iya sake wallafawa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba. Ba a taɓa duk abin da aka riga aka wallafa ba.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin daga wannan uwar garken ba, don haka babu abin da aka ɗora.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Wannan shafin ya kasa yada lodawa, don haka ba a aika komai ba.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin girmansa ya kai %1$s kuma PHP ɗin wannan rukunin yanar gizon ba shi da cURL, don haka mafi girman abin da zai iya lodawa shi ne %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Ba a iya kammala loda fayil ɗin ba.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Wurin ajiya ya ƙi loda fayil ɗin (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Saitin salon da aka riga aka sa','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Matsayin farawa. Duk wani abu a ƙasa yana shafe shi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmana na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma za a yi amfani da saitin kamar yadda yake.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan sakin Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® bai bayar da hanyar saukewa don wannan sabuntawar ba. Bincika cewa wannan rukunin yanar gizon na iya isa ga dandamalin Zinn®, sannan ku sake gwadawa.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ba a iya sauke sabuntawar daga sabis ɗin sabuntawa na Zinn® (%s) ba. Sake gwadawa bayan ƴan mintuna.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ɗaukakawar da aka saukar ta kasa cin jarrabawar inganci kuma ba a shigar da ita ba.']];